# Optional. Where the contact form POSTs its JSON payload.
#
# Leave unset and the form falls back to a pre-filled mail client handoff to
# siblini@cesolutionplus.com, which works on a purely static host.
#
# Set it to a real endpoint to capture submissions server-side. Examples:
#   Formspree      https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx
#   Netlify Forms  /
#   Azure Function https://<app>.azurewebsites.net/api/contact
#
# Must be prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_ — it is inlined into the client bundle, so never
# put a secret here.
NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
